'''Cow calves''' are low-[[Combat level|level]] [[monsters]] commonly found among [[cow]]s. Unlike [[dairy cows]], cow calves cannot be milked; attempting to do so using a bucket will display the message {{mes|Calves are too young to be milked}}.

