==Trivia==
*Using an item on a Cow calf prompts the message {{mes|The calf doesn't want that.}} as opposed to the usual {{mes|Nothing interesting happens.}}
*Using an empty bucket on a Cow calf instead prompts the message {{mes|Calves are too young to be milked.}}
*Using a bucket of milk on a Cow calf prompts the message {{mes|Calves aren't really used to drinking milk from buckets!}}

